@startuml
title 新用户注册通讯图

' 定义样式，使其更整洁
skinparam linestyle ortho
skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor White
    BorderColor Black
}

' 1. 定义参与交互的对象
object ":User" as User
object ":RegisterUI" as UI
object ":RegisterController" as Ctrl
object ":UserDB" as DB
object ":NotificationSystem" as System

' 2. 定义对象间的链接 (Links) 并附加消息 (Messages)
' 使用方向箭头字符 (<, >) 在文本中指示消息流向

User -right- UI : 1: inputRegisterInfo(email/studentId, password) > \n 9: showRegisterResult(result, notice) <

UI -right- Ctrl : 2: validateRegisterInfo(info) >

Ctrl -down- DB : 3: checkDuplicateAndValidity(info) > \n 4: returnValidateResult(result) < \n 5: createUserAccount(info) > \n 7: returnCreateResult(userId) <

' 自调用消息 (Self-Call)
DB -right- DB : 6: saveUserInfo(info)

Ctrl -right- System : 8: sendActivationNotice(userId, email) >

@enduml